{"slug":"The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-better-m1-reset-cuz-yall-so-buns-30610","_id":"67c1f4e57bcf96235eea0fae","title":"better m1 reset cuz yall so buns","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-c947df5b221c30672c3591247a8c6495-d88fb8427541.png","placeId":10449761463},"features":"Click R to get back and dash and click T After shove or front dashed (without R)\nsoon im upload uhhhh the mobile one","tags":[],"script":"local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal humanoidRootPart = character:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n-- Function to move the player\nlocal function movePlayer(offset)\n    humanoidRootPart.CFrame = humanoidRootPart.CFrame * CFrame.new(offset)\nend\n\n-- Listen for the key press events\nlocal userInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\n\nuserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(input, gameProcessedEvent)\n    if gameProcessedEvent then return end  -- Ignore if the game is processing the input already\n\n    if input.KeyCode == Enum.KeyCode.R then\n        -- Move the player back 34 studs (negative Z direction)\n        movePlayer(Vector3.new(0, 0, 34)) -- Moving back means negative Z axis in Roblox\n    elseif input.KeyCode == Enum.KeyCode.T then\n        -- Move the player forward 48.5 studs (positive Z direction)\n        movePlayer(Vector3.new(0, 0, -48.5)) -- Moving forward means positive Z axis in Roblox\n    end\nend)","owner":{"_id":"66cc7a141a098d63761bddd9","username":"Lee_everitt","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/66cc7a141a098d63761bddd9-1737981391272.png","status":"offline","id":"66cc7a141a098d63761bddd9","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":8134,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-02-28T17:39:49.792Z","dislikeCount":2,"likeCount":0,"ima